  "solution": {
    "approach": "Two common O(n) approaches: (1) Simulate row assignment: maintain an array of strings for each row, iterate characters while toggling direction when reaching top or bottom, then concatenate rows. (2) Use cycle arithmetic: cycle = 2*numRows - 2; for each row r, append characters at indices r + k*cycle and (k+1)*cycle - r when applicable. Both run in O(n) time and O(n) space for the output.",
    "timeComplexity": "O(n) where n = len(s)",
    "spaceComplexity": "O(n) for the output (plus O(numRows) auxiliary for row buffers)",
